{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">&quot;Zhong Kui - Netherblade&quot; is a highly mobile action Roguelike game. You will play as Zhong Kui, the legendary ghost-hunting deity from Chinese mythology, hacking and slashing wildly to thwart the King of Hell's conspiracy. Though dead, his heroic soul ventures into the underworld. Wielding a demon-slaying blade, he repels hordes of monsters and ghosts, collects upgrade items, and ultimately defeats the mastermind behind it all to attain the highest divine status in the underworld!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021010/extras/d94e3154e2454ecaa13caf41bb038653.avif?t=1768835751\" width=640 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021010/extras/519ffa9321406cfe11aa5e695dd28da6.poster.avif?t=1768835751\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021010/extras/519ffa9321406cfe11aa5e695dd28da6.webm?t=1768835751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021010/extras/519ffa9321406cfe11aa5e695dd28da6.mp4?t=1768835751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With highly mobile movement and combat skills, rediscover the exhilarating experience of arcade games through lightning-fast combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021010/extras/0fafbce47ae70d2bf5ddb1e1b37b8b93.avif?t=1768835751\" width=640 height=136 /></span></p>